    "note": "The finished design was read from Brian Wichmann’s MOR0910 vector drawing. The corners were snapped to exact values with the small star’s point radius as the unit. The drawing gives no steps. We devised the construction: the unit star and a square diagonal set the compass transfers, and earlier crossings give every remaining line.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. OA is the small star’s point radius; the cell half-side is two radii plus three square diagonals. The finished tile edges follow the plain drawing. The palette is illustrative; no photograph was checked.",
